/ActualText (Smart ID Locator Using Sensor and Mobile Technology is a smart identification system designed to help students locate a misplaced or missing school ID. The system embeds a coin-sized Bluetooth Low Energy\(BLE\)  sensor module inside a standard school ID card and connects it to a companion mobile application. \n\nThe mobile application allows students to monitor the proximity of their ID, receive alerts when the ID is separated from their phone, verify ownership, and view the last known location of the ID. The system may also provide access to the school's security office to assist in the recovery and verification of lost IDs.)
/K [3]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 462 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
