465 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (Students often misplace or lose their school IDs in classrooms, canteens, and other areas. This can result in replacement costs and delays in getting a new ID. Lost IDs may also be misused by other people to impersonate the owner. Current school IDs do not have a way to track their location or verify their rightful owner.)
/K [5]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 466 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
