469 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (The Smart ID Locator uses a BLE sensor embedded inside the school ID. A mobile application connects to the sensor to track the ID's proximity. The system sends alerts when the ID separates from the owner's phone and provides owner verification. It also records the last known GPS location to help students and security personnel find the missing ID.)
/K [7]
